# Perf Instrumentation

Coming soon — this page explains Reactor's performance instrumentation:
what's instrumented (every render, every effect, every reconciliation),
the ETW event sources, frame-aligned sampling (spec 031), layout-cost
attribution (spec 032), and how to read a flame graph of a Reactor
app. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Sibling page [Performance](performance.md) covers the user-facing
profiling story.
